      "claimId": "claim:b773b56d-599d-423f-9f68-cea8aaad6a72",
      "targetVersionId": "target-version:323bbbaf-d7f0-4120-930c-9331b3c1bc9f",
      "anchor": {
        "file": "main.tex",
        "excerptDigest": "sha256-6bb348b59c5a405e211940eaa9bcbf92f13a31e26915990aa03a3c6509fc4aab"
      },
      "text": "Theorem thm:lewis_weights: a randomized algorithm outputs a nonnegative diagonal Y with ≤ O(d log d/δ² log(1/η)) nonzeros which is a (1±δ) ℓ_1 subspace embedding with probability ≥ 1−η, computed in Õ(Nd + d^ω) arithmetic operations.",
      "normalizedTextDigest": "sha256-e78f8173d68c2cd902ea9190ad86f4230adcbf53f37530bab4b9ed05610dfdd1",
      "kind": "other",
